# Optional local override for the estimation engine root.
# One path per file (absolute, or relative to current_model/).
#
# Prefer STEEL_ENGINE_ROOT in .env for all environments.
# Mode B monorepo example (Lightsail):
#   /opt/steel-beam-estimation/SteelBeamEstimator/Version8
#
# Relative example:
#   ../../Version8
#
# Leave this file absent when:
#   - STEEL_ENGINE_ROOT is set, or
#   - the engine is packaged into current_model/ (Run_PY present), or
#   - a sibling Version8/ exists (auto-discovered by config/paths.py)
